{"id":"bedru_ckt","lemma":"bedrückt","pos":"adj","rank":4832,"glosses":["gloomy, depressed"],"ipa":"/bəˈdʁʏkt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ec/De-bedr%C3%BCckt.ogg/De-bedr%C3%BCckt.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"bedrückter","superlative":"am bedrücktesten"},"examples":[{"text":"Ist es das, was dich bedrückt?","en":"Is that what's eating you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/700279","words":[{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"you","l":"du"},null]},{"text":"Das bedrückt mich ein bisschen.","en":"It depresses me a bit.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"bit"}]},{"text":"Du siehst bedrückt aus. Ist etwas passiert?","en":"You look depressed. Did something happen?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"},null,{"g":"out of / from"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"something"},{"g":"to happen","l":"passieren"}]},{"text":"Erzähl mir doch, was dich wirklich bedrückt.","en":"Why don't you tell me what's really bothering you?","words":[{"g":"to tell","l":"erzählen"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"but / yes"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"you","l":"du"},{"g":"really, actually"},null]},{"text":"Warum erzählst du mir nicht, was dich wirklich bedrückt?","en":"Why don't you tell me what's really bothering you?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"to tell","l":"erzählen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"you","l":"du"},{"g":"really, actually"},null]}]}